1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,250
This is four hundred and fifty dollars.

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:06,350
It called you at seven forty on a Tuesday.

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:10,240
You were under a container with your gloves on.

4
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:13,150
It went to voicemail.

5
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,910
Then it called the next hauler on Google.

6
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:23,370
You didn't lose that job because you're slow.

7
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:27,790
You lost it because booking needed you awake.

8
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,700
So take yourself out of it.

9
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:35,670
Your sizes. Your rates. Your zip codes.

10
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,700
Three minutes, once.

11
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:40,580
Then the link does the asking.

12
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:44,260
They pick a size, pick a date, and pay you.

13
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:48,390
Your driver gets a text. No app.

14
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:52,120
Zero a month to start. No contract.

15
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:55,410
The next seven forty books itself.

16
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:59,880
RollOS. Start free in three minutes.
